



xd [-_o_p_t_i_o_n(s)] [GPS _f_i_l_e_s(s)];  display GPS on a Triple X

Convert GPS format into output codes for a Triple X
console.

Options:

     e#        expand region # to fill the display.
	       If # is missing region 13 (the
	       central region) is displayed.

Example:   td A.g B.g
displays A.g and B.g.
